    {
      "source": "<a href=\"RedisEntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.repository.core\"><code>RedisEntityInformation</code></a> implementation using a <a href=\"../../core/mapping/RedisPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.mapping\"><code>RedisPersistentEntity</code></a> instance to lookup the necessary\ninformation. Can be configured with a custom collection to be returned which will trump the one returned by the\n<a href=\"../../core/mapping/RedisPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.mapping\"><code>RedisPersistentEntity</code></a> if given.",
      "translation": "使用 <a href=\"../../core/mapping/RedisPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>RedisPersistentEntity</code></a> 实例来查找必要信息的 <a href=\"RedisEntityInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.repository.core 中的接口\"><code>RedisEntityInformation</code></a> 实现。可以配置为返回自定义集合，如果提供了该自定义集合，它将覆盖由 <a href=\"../../core/mapping/RedisPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>RedisPersistentEntity</code></a> 返回的集合。",
